{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261001080437_26a4eb33","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_42b0e11fa4158d6da9914cc5","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001080437_26a4eb33","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_a8b4295f1524f5cdf0a85e32","precondition_digest":"7c91e7c1f7976522b36f466f3ccd4e65739d7618408eef192af66168a0786719","project_id":"proj_user_bb41368e3c4b","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_805143a942ba64ed","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_fa84241464e10c87","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_612f662fa7f2eea5","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_343f0079a354aa2c"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001080437_26a4eb33","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索试验","quote_sha256":"61f9ff3ce2d0aa21f4fa0e60669238ececc1087df70777b2d228130d77836202","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"18-75岁慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，LVEF≤40%、NYHA II-III级）成人患者，已接受指南导向的标准药物治疗（含ARNI/ACEI/ARB、β受体阻滞剂、MRA及SGLT2抑制剂）仍残留症状","quote_sha256":"e9475d1fceca064f0bfb1420ae694f292be03a666b2aa6e09a403b8f98e9cb4d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"4组按1:1:1:1随机分配","quote_sha256":"9a3a297295b21d2012dcd664c8b30990356d67fd6995470a478a89d8f2b25bbe","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"主要终点：第12周血浆NT-proBNP较基线的相对变化（对数尺度）；评价时点：基线、第4周、第8周、第12周","quote_sha256":"5949a234d0cd6f3833aa4c15e07d10ca7178fa7d59746f16d35b225f5090de16","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"探索性样本量：每剂量组40例、安慰剂组40例，合计约160例；假设20mg组NT-proBNP较安慰剂多降低15%，双侧α=0.10下检验效能约80%；考虑10%脱落计划入组176例","quote_sha256":"cda56d7cf71b8e4f289e7513b4f65529e6687b95621a31d3c1f213ac9507ce6f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es3","es4","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为一项随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索临床试验，旨在评价口服sGC激动剂SGC-R11在慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，HFrEF）成人患者中的概念验证及剂量-效应关系。目标研究人群为18至75岁、LVEF≤40%、NYHA心功能II至III级的慢性心力衰竭（缺血性或非缺血性）成人患者，在指南导向标准抗心衰药物治疗（含ARNI/ACEI/ARB、β受体阻滞剂、MRA及SGLT2抑制剂）稳定至少4周基础上仍残留症状。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至SGC-R11 5mg组、10mg组、20mg组或安慰剂组，各组均联合标准背景抗心衰治疗，口服每日一次，疗程12周。主要终点为第12周血浆NT-proBNP较基线的相对变化（对数尺度），评价时点包括基线、第4周、第8周和第12周。关键次要终点为第12周6分钟步行距离较基线变化及第12周KCCQ总分较基线变化。其他次要终点包括第12周LVEF较基线变化和NYHA分级改善比例。探索性终点为第12周可溶性sGC活性标志物与cGMP水平变化。安全性评价涵盖不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与晕厥事件发生率以及生命体征、心电图和实验室检查异常。研究时期包括筛选期（第-2周至第0天）、双盲治疗期（第0天至第12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后4周）。样本量策略为每剂量组40例、安慰剂组40例，合计约160例；假设20mg组NT-proBNP较安慰剂多降低15%，双侧α=0.10下检验效能约80%；考虑10%脱落计划入组176例。主要分析采用ANCOVA（基线log-NT-proBNP为协变量，固定效应含剂量组与分层因素），剂量-效应Emax模型进行探索性拟合，次要终点采用层级序贯检验，安全性进行描述性统计，主要分析集为FAS，PPS作为敏感性分析。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体研究设计、目标人群、干预方案、终点定义、访视策略、样本量策略和统计分析策略逐项写入。样本量假设参数（15%差异、α=0.10、80%效能）为探索性设计假设，需医学经理确认是否以当前表述纳入方案正式文本。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_805143a942ba64ed","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5d8350063c7beea7f76508cf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001080437_26a4eb33","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充HFrEF流行病学、疾病负担及当前治疗现状的项目级来源文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_disease_bg_01","missing_source_classes":["HFrEF流行病学与疾病负担文献","慢性心衰诊疗指南","HFrEF治疗格局与未满足需求综述"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状章节正文"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["HFrEF流行病学与疾病负担文献","中国或国际慢性心衰诊疗指南（如中国心衰指南、ESC心衰指南）","HFrEF当前标准治疗格局及未满足需求综述"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要HFrEF流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、预后）、疾病负担描述、现行中国或国际心衰诊疗指南中关于标准治疗路径的引用，以及当前治疗格局中未满足需求的来源。当前允许来源中无上述任何项目级资料，仅有疾病名称标签，无法撰写实质正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_fa84241464e10c87","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5d8350063c7beea7f76508cf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f